  "steps": [
    "Whip the cream and condensed milk on high speed for 3–5 minutes until thick and holding a peak.",
    "Fold in 2 tbsp Biscoff spread, spread into a lined loaf tin, swirl in a little melted Biscoff if you like, cover and freeze at least 6 hours, ideally overnight.",
    "Warm each stroopwafel in a dry pan for 15–20 seconds per side until it bends, fold it into a taco shape and chill to set.",
    "Fill the shells with ice cream, smooth the top and freeze for 40–60 minutes.",
    "Dunk the tops in melted (cooled) Biscoff spread and sprinkle with biscuit crumbs."
  ]
